

1. Environment Setup & Launch


export ISAAC_ROS_WS=~/workspaces/isaac_ros-dev
cd $ISAAC_ROS_WS

./src/isaac_ros_common/scripts/run_dev.sh




2. Hardware Camera Node (v4l2_camera)

ros2 run v4l2_camera v4l2_camera_node --ros-args   -p video_device:=/dev/video0   -p image_size:="[640,512]"   -p camera_info_url:=file:///home/marwa/workspaces/isaac_ros-dev/src/cameraconfig/thermal_camera.yaml   -r image_raw:=image



3. Preprocessing & Tensor Encoding (dnn_image_encoder)

ros2 launch isaac_ros_dnn_image_encoder dnn_image_encoder.launch.py \
  input_image_width:=640 \
  input_image_height:=512 \
  network_image_width:=640 \
  network_image_height:=512 \
  image_input_topic:=/image \
  camera_info_input_topic:=/camera_info \
  tensor_output_topic:=/tensor_pub





4. Model Inference (isaac_ros_tensor_rt)

ros2 launch isaac_ros_tensor_rt isaac_ros_tensor_rt.launch.py \
  engine_file_path:=/workspaces/isaac_ros-dev/src/model/best.plan \
  input_tensor_names:='["images"]' \
  input_binding_names:='["images"]' \
  output_tensor_names:='["output0"]' \
  output_binding_names:='["output0"]'




5. Post-Processing & Bounding Box Visualization

python3 /workspaces/isaac_ros-dev/src/isaac_ros_object_detection/isaac_ros_yolov8/scripts/isaac_ros_yolov8_visualizer.py





6. GUI Monitoring (rqt_image_view)
ros2 run rqt_image_view rqt_image_view































